{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.TraceIsWeighted","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.TraceIsWeighted","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.WeightedTraceGram","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.StdBasis"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.blockWeight_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.blockWeight_eq","kind":"theorem","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L162-L166","doc":"The block weight, read off any diagonal unit — independent of the choice. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.eq_weightedTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.eq_weightedTrace","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L129-L159","doc":"**Every trace on a product of matrix algebras is a weighted trace.**\n\n`t(xy) = t(yx)` forces `t = Σ_i c_i · tr(x_i)` with `c_i` the value of `t`\non any diagonal matrix unit of block `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.apply_blockUnit_diag_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.apply_blockUnit_diag_eq","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L107-L125","doc":"**A trace is constant on the diagonal units of a block.**  `E_aa = E_ab E_ba`\nand `E_bb = E_ba E_ab`, so the two values agree.  This is what makes the\nblock weight independent of the chosen diagonal unit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.apply_blockUnit_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.apply_blockUnit_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L85-L104","doc":"**A trace kills off-diagonal matrix units.**  `E_ab = E_aa E_ab` while\n`E_ab E_aa = 0` when `b ≠ a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.blockUnitBasis_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.blockUnitBasis_apply","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L78-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.blockUnitBasis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.blockUnitBasis","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L72-L76","doc":"**The matrix units are a basis of the product**, indexed exactly as\n`weightedGram` is. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.weightedTraceₗ_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.weightedTraceₗ_apply","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L69-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.weightedTraceₗ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.weightedTraceₗ","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/TraceIsWeighted.lean#L57-L66","doc":"`weightedTrace c` as a linear map. ","signatureChunk":0}]}